        <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-3">Important Conditions</h5>

        <ul class="mb-0">
            <li>Marks of NCC and Hifz-e-Quran are only for merit, not eligibility.</li>
            <li class="text-danger">Rounding off percentage to reach eligibility is not allowed.</li>
            <li>Applicant must be a bonafide resident of the relevant area.</li>
            <li>Medical fitness (Form F-V) is required.</li>
            <li>Applicant must appear in Entry Test (TCAT / ECAT or equivalent).</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

